    "title": "WIP: enhance: add host.stable_workdir for predictable host job paths",
    "body": "Adds an opt-in `host.stable_workdir` that runs host jobs in `<host.workdir_parent>/workspaces/<owner>/<repo>/<slot>/hostexecutor` instead of a random directory, so they are easy to find and set permissions on. Only the path is stable: contents are still removed after each job, and the path is fully stable only at capacity 1.\n\nDepends on https://gitea.com/orbit/orbit/pulls/1401 for the slot allocator, please merge that first. Until then this PR also shows its commit.\n\nFixes: https://gitea.com/orbit/orbit/issues/1373\n",
